<header class="page-intro friends-intro" data-reveal>
  <div>
    <p
      class="eyebrow"
      th:with="configuredEyebrow=${linksPage != null ? #annotations.get(linksPage, 'akari.theme.halo.run/links-eyebrow') : ''}"
    >
      <span>NEIGHBORHOOD</span> · <akari-halo-tag-th-block
        th:text="${#strings.isEmpty(configuredEyebrow) ? #messages.msg('links.eyebrow') : configuredEyebrow}"
        >友邻门牌</akari-halo-tag-th-block
      >
    </p>
    <h1
      th:with="configuredTitle=${linksPage != null ? #annotations.get(linksPage, 'akari.theme.halo.run/links-title') : ''}"
      th:text="${#strings.isEmpty(configuredTitle) ? #messages.msg('links.heroTitle') : configuredTitle}"
    >
      顺着灯光去串门。
    </h1>
    <p
      th:with="configuredSubtitle=${linksPage != null ? #annotations.get(linksPage, 'akari.theme.halo.run/links-subtitle') : ''}"
      th:text="${#strings.isEmpty(configuredSubtitle) ? #messages.msg('links.subtitle') : configuredSubtitle}"
    >
      不是互换权重的名单，是我会认真打开、偶尔留言的个人站点。
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="door-sign">
    <span class="i-lucide-lamp-wall-up"></span><span
      th:text="#{links.count(${linkCount})}">12 户亮着灯</span
    >
  </div>
</header>

<section
  class="friend-group"
  th:each="linkGroup,groupStat : ${linkGroups}"
  th:if="${not #lists.isEmpty(linkGroup.links)}"
>
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">LINK GROUP</p><h2
        th:text="${linkGroup.spec.displayName}"
      >
        常来串门
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p th:text="#{links.count(${#lists.size(linkGroup.links)})}">12 户亮着灯</p>
  </div>
  <div class="friend-grid">
    <a
      class="friend-card"
      th:each="link,stat : ${linkGroup.links}"
      th:href="${link.spec.url}"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      data-reveal
    >
      <span
        class="friend-avatar friend-avatar-stack"
        th:classappend="${stat.index % 4 == 0 ? ' avatar-coral' : (stat.index % 4 == 1 ? ' avatar-mint' : (stat.index % 4 == 2 ? ' avatar-sun' : ' avatar-berry'))}"
      >
        <span
          th:text="${#strings.toUpperCase(#strings.substring(link.spec.displayName,0,1))}"
          >木</span
        >
        <img
          th:if="${not #strings.isEmpty(link.spec.logo)}"
          th:src="${link.spec.logo}"
          th:alt="${link.spec.displayName}"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </span>
      <div>
        <p>
          <strong th:text="${link.spec.displayName}">木屿手帐</strong><span
            class="online-dot"></span>
        </p>
        <small th:text="${linkGroup.spec.displayName}">插画 · 手帐 · 植物</small
        >
        <p th:text="${link.spec.description}">认真生活的个人站点。</p>
        <span class="friend-visit"
          ><span th:text="#{links.visit}">去串门</span>
          <span class="i-lucide-arrow-up-right"></span></span
        >
      </div>
    </a>
    <a
      class="friend-card friend-invite"
      th:if="${groupStat.last and guestbookPage != null}"
      th:href="${guestbookPage.status.permalink}"
      data-reveal
    >
      <span class="friend-avatar"><span class="i-lucide-plus"></span></span>
      <div>
        <p>
          <strong th:text="#{links.applyTitle}">留一盏空灯</strong>
        </p>
        <small th:text="#{links.applyLabel}">欢迎认真生活的个人博客</small>
        <p th:text="#{links.applyDescription}">
          请先来留言簿坐一会儿，再交换彼此的门牌。
        </p>
        <span class="friend-visit"
          ><span th:text="#{links.applyAction}">去写小纸条</span>
          <span class="i-lucide-arrow-right"></span></span
        >
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<aside
  class="friend-note"
  th:with="configuredPolicyTitle=${linksPage != null ? #annotations.get(linksPage, 'akari.theme.halo.run/links-policy-title') : ''},configuredPolicy=${linksPage != null ? #annotations.get(linksPage, 'akari.theme.halo.run/links-policy') : ''}"
>
  <span class="i-lucide-shield-check"></span>
  <div>
    <strong
      th:text="${#strings.isEmpty(configuredPolicyTitle) ? #messages.msg('links.policyTitle') : configuredPolicyTitle}"
      >关于这些门牌</strong
    >
    <p
      th:text="${not #strings.isEmpty(configuredPolicy) ? configuredPolicy : (not #strings.isEmpty(legacyPolicy) and legacyPolicy != '48 px 头像、两行近况、明确状态；失联站点保留 90 天后移入纪念册，不用灰掉的卡片制造压力。' ? legacyPolicy : #messages.msg('links.policyText'))}"
    >
      这里收录的是我愿意常来串门的站点。
    </p>
  </div>
</aside>
